# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "What's next? {#whats-next}"
msgstr "¿Qué sigue? {#whats-next}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now that you’ve learned the fundamentals of quantum-safe cryptography, "
"explore the technologies IBM Quantum&reg; offers for modernizing your "
"cryptographic landscape and building quantum cyber resilience. [IBM Quantum "
"Safe&trade;](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/quantum-safe) is a comprehensive "
"set of tools, capabilities, and approaches combined with deep expertise to "
"help you plan and execute your organization’s migration to quantum-safe "
"cryptography. Discover, observe, and transform your cryptography with three "
"core technical capabilities:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ahora que conoces los fundamentos de la criptografía cuántica segura, "
"explora las tecnologías que IBM Quantum&reg; ofrece para modernizar tu "
"panorama criptográfico y construir resiliencia cuántica en ciberseguridad. "
"[IBM Quantum Safe&trade;](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/quantum-safe) es un "
"conjunto integral de herramientas, capacidades y enfoques, combinado con una"
" profunda experiencia, para apoyar a tu organización en la migración hacia "
"la criptografía cuántica segura. Descubre, observa y transforma tu "
"criptografía con tres capacidades técnicas centrales:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**1. IBM Quantum Safe Explorer**\n"
msgstr "**1. IBM Quantum Safe Explorer**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM Quantum Safe Explorer simplifies the discovery and management of "
"cryptography by performing source code and object code scanning to identify "
"all cryptographically relevant artifacts, uncover dependencies, and surface "
"vulnerabilities. Explorer represents this data in a [Cryptography Bill of "
"Materials](https://github.com/IBM/CBOM) (CBOM), a common extension to the "
"Software Bill of Materials (SBOM) that systematizes the creation and sharing"
" of metadata describing cryptographic artifacts.\n"
msgstr ""
"IBM Quantum Safe Explorer simplifica la detección y gestión de la "
"criptografía al escanear código fuente y código objeto para identificar "
"todos los artefactos relevantes para la criptografía, descubrir dependencias"
" y hacer visibles las vulnerabilidades. Explorer presenta estos datos en un "
"[Cryptography Bill of Materials](https://github.com/IBM/CBOM) (CBOM) — una "
"extensión común del Software Bill of Materials (SBOM), que sistematiza la "
"creación y el intercambio de metadatos sobre artefactos criptográficos.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**2. IBM Quantum Safe Advisor**\n"
msgstr "**2. IBM Quantum Safe Advisor**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM Quantum Safe Advisor complements the static code analysis from IBM "
"Quantum Safe Explorer with a dynamic, runtime perspective of your "
"cryptographic posture and compliance. Advisor correlates [CBOMs][CBOM] and "
"aggregates data from network and endpoint scans to build a comprehensive "
"cryptographic inventory. This inventory details:\n"
msgstr ""
"IBM Quantum Safe Advisor complementa el análisis estático de código de IBM "
"Quantum Safe Explorer con una perspectiva dinámica en tiempo de ejecución de"
" tu postura de seguridad criptográfica y cumplimiento. Advisor correlaciona "
"[CBOMs][CBOM] y agrega datos de escaneos de red y puntos finales para "
"construir un inventario criptográfico completo. Este inventario contiene "
"detalles sobre:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The types and locations of your cryptographic instances\n"
msgstr "Los tipos y ubicaciones de tus instancias criptográficas\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Associated certificates, cipher suites, and CBOMs\n"
msgstr "Certificados asociados, suites de cifrado y CBOMs\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The relationships between assets and data flows\n"
msgstr "Las relaciones entre activos y flujos de datos\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Potential vulnerabilities to quantum technology\n"
msgstr "Vulnerabilidades potenciales frente a la tecnología cuántica\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"With its policy-based enrichment, Advisor equips you to evaluate your "
"cryptography and data compliance and generate a prioritized list of "
"vulnerabilities so that you can establish a quantum-safe remediation "
"strategy.\n"
msgstr ""
"Con su enriquecimiento basado en políticas, Advisor permite evaluar tu "
"criptografía y cumplimiento de datos, así como crear una lista priorizada de"
" vulnerabilidades, para que puedas desarrollar una estrategia de remediación"
" cuántica segura.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**3. IBM Quantum Safe Remediator**\n"
msgstr "**3. IBM Quantum Safe Remediator**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM Quantum Safe Remediator enables you to apply best practices for quantum-"
"safe remediation patterns focused on VPN communication, TLS communication, "
"and cluster access communication. Build crypto-agility by exploring "
"solutions for transforming your cryptography without disrupting business "
"operations.\n"
msgstr ""
"IBM Quantum Safe Remediator te permite aplicar las mejores prácticas de "
"patrones de remediación cuántica segura que se centran en comunicación VPN, "
"comunicación TLS y comunicación de acceso a clústeres. Construye agilidad "
"criptográfica explorando soluciones para transformar tu criptografía sin "
"interrumpir las operaciones comerciales.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read the [technology guide](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/assets/quantum-"
"safe/IBM_Quantum-Safe-Technology-Brochure.pdf), and learn more on the [IBM "
"Quantum Safe site.](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/quantum-safe)\n"
msgstr ""
"Lee la [guía tecnológica](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/assets/quantum-"
"safe/IBM_Quantum-Safe-Technology-Brochure.pdf) y obtén más información en el"
" [sitio web de IBM Quantum Safe.](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/quantum-"
"safe)\n"

